  "prefLabel": "He-E 310.12 Grievance Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 310.12 Grievance Records. BAAS shall maintain a record of each grievance received which shall include:\n\n(a) A general description of the reason for the grievance;\n\n(b) The date the grievance was received by BAAS;\n\n(c) The date of each meeting held pursuant to He-E 310.10(a) above;\n\n(d) The resolution of the grievance;\n\n(e) The date of the resolution; and\n\n(f) The name of the participant for whom the grievance was filed.\n\nSource. #14058, eff 8-20-24\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e300.html"
